{"success":true,"data":{"name":"All Mobile Courses (Combo)- Earners","description":"<!DOCTYPE html>\n<html>\n\n  <head>\n     <style>\n       .desc-container {\n         display: flex;\n         flex-direction: column;\n         padding: 16px 13px;\n       }\n       \n       .desc-row {\n         display: flex;\n         align-items: center;\n         margin-bottom: 16px;\n         border-bottom: 1px solid #efefef;\n         padding: 4px 0;\n       }\n       \n       .desc-row-item-title {\n         font-size: 14px;\n         line-height: 22px;\n         margin-right: 6px;\n       }\n\n       .desc-row-item-content {\n         font-size: 14px;\n         line-height: 18px;\n         margin-right: 6px;\n       }\n     </style>\n  </head>\n\n  <body>\n<div class=\"desc-container\">\n<div class=\"desc-row\">\n<div class=\"desc-row-item-title\"><span id=\"docs-internal-guid-f6404f5b-7fff-b28e-c1e3-5a45eda296c3\"><span style=\"font-size: 11pt; font-family: Arial, sans-serif; background-color: transparent; font-weight: bold; font-variant-numeric: normal; font-variant-east-asian: normal; font-variant-alternates: normal; font-variant-position: normal; font-variant-emoji: normal; vertical-align: baseline; white-space-collapse: preserve;\">Content Creation Combo Pack for Mobile Users (Recorded)</span><span style=\"font-size: 11pt; font-family: Arial, sans-serif; background-color: transparent; font-variant-numeric: normal; font-variant-east-asian: normal; font-variant-alternates: normal; font-variant-position: normal; font-variant-emoji: normal; vertical-align: baseline; white-space-collapse: preserve;\"> is a beginner-friendly program designed to help you learn complete content creation skills and explore real earning opportunities.</span></span></div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"desc-row\">\n<div class=\"desc-row-item-content\"><span id=\"docs-internal-guid-724ae043-7fff-d19e-884a-dfa39a1904f4\"><span style=\"font-size: 11pt; font-family: Arial, sans-serif; background-color: transparent; font-variant-numeric: normal; font-variant-east-asian: normal; font-variant-alternates: normal; font-variant-position: normal; font-variant-emoji: normal; vertical-align: baseline; white-space-collapse: preserve;\">In this combo, you will learn:</span></span></div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"desc-row\">\n<div class=\"desc-row-item-title\">01.</div>\n<div class=\"desc-row-item-content\"><span id=\"docs-internal-guid-e7c154aa-7fff-28b9-e29c-7169d16c3f54\"><span style=\"font-size: 11pt; font-family: Arial, sans-serif; background-color: transparent; font-variant-numeric: normal; font-variant-east-asian: normal; font-variant-alternates: normal; font-variant-position: normal; font-variant-emoji: normal; vertical-align: baseline; white-space-collapse: preserve;\">Video editing using mobile (CapCut, Alight Motion, VN, etc.)</span></span></div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"desc-row\">\n<div class=\"desc-row-item-title\">02.</div>\n<div class=\"desc-row-item-content\"><span id=\"docs-internal-guid-46bf83d3-7fff-379a-9fa8-82642a910adb\"><span style=\"font-size: 11pt; font-family: Arial, sans-serif; background-color: transparent; font-variant-numeric: normal; font-variant-east-asian: normal; font-variant-alternates: normal; font-variant-position: normal; font-variant-emoji: normal; vertical-align: baseline; white-space-collapse: preserve;\">Graphic designing for posts, thumbnails, and branding</span></span></div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"desc-row\">\n<div class=\"desc-row-item-title\">03.</div>\n<div class=\"desc-row-item-content\"><span id=\"docs-internal-guid-b38d0820-7fff-5a68-dd00-b3fc7b7a9435\"><span style=\"font-size: 11pt; font-family: Arial, sans-serif; background-color: transparent; font-variant-numeric: normal; font-variant-east-asian: normal; font-variant-alternates: normal; font-variant-position: normal; font-variant-emoji: normal; vertical-align: baseline; white-space-collapse: preserve;\">Instagram growth, reels strategy, and content planning</span></span></div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"desc-row\">\n<div class=\"desc-row-item-title\">04.</div>\n<div class=\"desc-row-item-content\"><span id=\"docs-internal-guid-1ed5cb62-7fff-75d8-4b1b-bf0d61bf9314\"><span style=\"font-size: 11pt; font-family: Arial, sans-serif; background-color: transparent; font-variant-numeric: normal; font-variant-east-asian: normal; font-variant-alternates: normal; font-variant-position: normal; font-variant-emoji: normal; vertical-align: baseline; white-space-collapse: preserve;\">YouTube channel setup, content ideas using AI, and growth basics</span></span></div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"desc-row\">\n<div class=\"desc-row-item-title\">05.</div>\n<div class=\"desc-row-item-content\"><span id=\"docs-internal-guid-8af6344e-7fff-84fd-13d2-14c357b01a85\"><span style=\"font-size: 11pt; font-family: Arial, sans-serif; background-color: transparent; font-variant-numeric: normal; font-variant-east-asian: normal; font-variant-alternates: normal; font-variant-position: normal; font-variant-emoji: normal; vertical-align: baseline; white-space-collapse: preserve;\">AI tools (ChatGPT, Gemini) for faster content creation and workflow</span></span></div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"desc-row\">\n<div class=\"desc-row-item-title\">06.</div>\n<div class=\"desc-row-item-content\"><span id=\"docs-internal-guid-da58c0b3-7fff-922a-98a8-55788b425bdf\"><span style=\"font-size: 11pt; font-family: Arial, sans-serif; background-color: transparent; font-weight: bold; font-variant-numeric: normal; font-variant-east-asian: normal; font-variant-alternates: normal; font-variant-position: normal; font-variant-emoji: normal; vertical-align: baseline; white-space-collapse: preserve;\">Access to all 5 courses</span></span></div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"desc-row\">\n<div class=\"desc-row-item-title\">07.</div>\n<div class=\"desc-row-item-content\"><span id=\"docs-internal-guid-3d75aa5d-7fff-9c86-c3d2-0d4cd32a9508\"><span style=\"font-size: 11pt; font-family: Arial, sans-serif; background-color: transparent; font-weight: bold; font-variant-numeric: normal; font-variant-east-asian: normal; font-variant-alternates: normal; font-variant-position: normal; font-variant-emoji: normal; vertical-align: baseline; white-space-collapse: preserve;\">Duration:</span><span style=\"font-size: 11pt; font-family: Arial, sans-serif; background-color: transparent; font-variant-numeric: normal; font-variant-east-asian: normal; font-variant-alternates: normal; font-variant-position: normal; font-variant-emoji: normal; vertical-align: baseline; white-space-collapse: preserve;\"> 6 months</span></span></div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"desc-row\">\n<div class=\"desc-row-item-title\">08.</div>\n<div class=\"desc-row-item-content\"><span id=\"docs-internal-guid-f2ba0994-7fff-b971-3721-612558c09667\"><span style=\"font-size: 11pt; font-family: Arial, sans-serif; background-color: transparent; font-weight: bold; font-variant-numeric: normal; font-variant-east-asian: normal; font-variant-alternates: normal; font-variant-position: normal; font-variant-emoji: normal; vertical-align: baseline; white-space-collapse: preserve;\">Regular assignments for practice</span></span></div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"desc-row\">\n<div class=\"desc-row-item-title\">09.</div>\n<div class=\"desc-row-item-content\"><span id=\"docs-internal-guid-3142a983-7fff-c7c2-82a1-ac7ba589fcd3\"><span style=\"font-size: 11pt; font-family: Arial, sans-serif; background-color: transparent; font-weight: bold; font-variant-numeric: normal; font-variant-east-asian: normal; font-variant-alternates: normal; font-variant-position: normal; font-variant-emoji: normal; vertical-align: baseline; white-space-collapse: preserve;\">Weekly doubt support sessions</span></span></div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"desc-row\">\n<div class=\"desc-row-item-title\">10.</div>\n<div class=\"desc-row-item-content\"><span id=\"docs-internal-guid-849808db-7fff-d4dc-d288-9462172a6927\"><span style=\"font-size: 11pt; font-family: Arial, sans-serif; background-color: transparent; font-weight: bold; font-variant-numeric: normal; font-variant-east-asian: normal; font-variant-alternates: normal; font-variant-position: normal; font-variant-emoji: normal; vertical-align: baseline; white-space-collapse: preserve;\">2-year validity for the All Mobile Combo course</span></span></div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"desc-row\">\n<div class=\"desc-row-item-title\">11.</div>\n<div class=\"desc-row-item-content\"><span id=\"docs-internal-guid-57adb57b-7fff-e90d-e387-9a0a72a0158e\"><span style=\"font-size: 11pt; font-family: Arial, sans-serif; background-color: transparent; font-variant-numeric: normal; font-variant-east-asian: normal; font-variant-alternates: normal; font-variant-position: normal; font-variant-emoji: normal; vertical-align: baseline; white-space-collapse: preserve;\">This program focuses on </span><span style=\"font-size: 11pt; font-family: Arial, sans-serif; background-color: transparent; font-weight: bold; font-variant-numeric: normal; font-variant-east-asian: normal; font-variant-alternates: normal; font-variant-position: normal; font-variant-emoji: normal; vertical-align: baseline; white-space-collapse: preserve;\">practical learning</span><span style=\"font-size: 11pt; font-family: Arial, sans-serif; background-color: transparent; font-variant-numeric: normal; font-variant-east-asian: normal; font-variant-alternates: normal; font-variant-position: normal; font-variant-emoji: normal; vertical-align: baseline; white-space-collapse: preserve;\">, so you can start creating content, build your portfolio, and explore opportunities like freelancing, content creation, or social media management.</span></span></div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"desc-row\">\n<div class=\"desc-row-item-title\">12.</div>\n<div class=\"desc-row-item-content\">\n<div>For App/Web Navigation the latest Feature Updates &amp; Student Support please subscribe to our Support YouTube channel:<br /><a href=\"https://www.youtube.com/@pwstudentsupport\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener nofollow noreferrer\">https://www.youtube.com/@pwstudentsupport</a></div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</body>\n</html>","shortDescription":"<!DOCTYPE html>\n<html lang=\"en\">\n <head>\n   <meta charset=\"UTF-8\" />\n   <style>\n     .description-meta-container {\n       display: flex !important;\n       flex-direction: column !important;\n       gap: 14px !important;\n     }\n\n     .child-container {\n       display: flex !important;\n       align-items: center !important;\n       gap: 12px !important;\n     }\n\n     .icon {\n       width: 32px !important;\n       height: 32px !important;\n     }\n\n     .sub-text {\n       font-size: 14px !important;\n       font-weight: 500 !important;\n     }\n\n     .main-text {\n       font-size: 14px !important;\n       font-weight: 600 !important;\n     }\n\n     .text {\n       font-size: 14px !important;\n       font-weight: 500 !important;\n     }\n\n     .text-container {\n       display: flex !important;\n       flex-direction: column !important;\n       gap: 4px !important;\n     }\n   </style>\n </head>\n <body>\n<div class=\"description-meta-container\">\n<div class=\"child-container\"><img class=\"icon\" src=\"https://static.pw.live/5eb393ee95fab7468a79d189/f463046e-0ed5-43b3-981c-944985082135.png\" />\n<div class=\"text-container\"><span class=\"sub-text\">Course Duration: </span> <span class=\"main-text\">02 May 2026 - 02 Nov 2026</span></div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"child-container\"><img class=\"icon\" src=\"https://static.pw.live/5eb393ee95fab7468a79d189/972706bc-b79b-41e5-99b4-230290bd296c.png\" />\n<div class=\"text-container\"><span class=\"sub-text\"> Validity: </span> <span class=\"main-text\">02 May 2028</span></div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"child-container\"><img class=\"icon\" src=\"https://static.pw.live/5eb393ee95fab7468a79d189/9cbf5ddd-2a54-4f92-823c-e908856223c9.png\" /><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\"><span id=\"docs-internal-guid-73b5c478-7fff-9cc9-348b-ed4c23160be9\"><span style=\"font-size: 11pt; font-f